(7722980, 1271380, 63398, '<td valign="top">The negative space is a very powerful effect making this a striking, in-your-face image. A real grabber. VERY nice. 8</td>', 'The negative space is a very powerful effect making this a striking, in-your-face image. A real grabber. VERY nice. 8', '2022-07-07 22:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
