(7722982, 1271260, 63398, '<td valign="top">I love the crisp detail, the rich color, yet still having a loose wildness about the scene. The somber sky is a terrific touch, almost brings a selective desaturation feel to it, yet it seems so natural. I like this a lot. I''d live there in a heartbeat.8</td>', 'I love the crisp detail, the rich color, yet still having a loose wildness about the scene. The somber sky is a terrific touch, almost brings a selective desaturation feel to it, yet it seems so natural. I like this a lot. I''d live there in a heartbeat.8', '2022-07-07 22:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7722983, 1271432, 63398, '<td valign="top">Though the image is somewhat title driven, I like that you saw that and it works well. Nice silhouetting. 7</td>', 'Though the image is somewhat title driven, I like that you saw that and it works well. Nice silhouetting. 7', '2022-07-07 22:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
